Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,could the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,dallas cowboys hold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:02.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,a 6-point lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,for 74 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:05.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,against 50 grandmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:05.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,the grandmas have an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:07.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,average age of 81.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,their fastest player
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,uses a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:09.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,dallas has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:11.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,53 pro athletes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,74 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:13.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,except, it's dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,last sunday, dallas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,led arizona by 14
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,with 14 minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,they still led
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:20.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,by 6 with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,74 seconds to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,arizona scored with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,10 seconds left, then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,missed the extra point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,dallas was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:27.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,and lost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,in overtime anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,so grandmas ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,grandma ruth hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:32.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,off to grandma june.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:34.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,dallas misses 6 tackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:34.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:35.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,the extra point bounces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,off a hip replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:38.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,grandmas win 33-30.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,dallas falls to 3-5.
